# Cloudflare Pages _headers
# Order matters: most specific paths first. The .jsx and .js MIME rules below
# are load-bearing. The app loads modules via <script type="text/babel" src="*.jsx">
# and Pages would otherwise serve .jsx with a non-script Content-Type, which
# modern browsers refuse to execute. Do not remove or reorder these two rules
# above the catch-all security block.

/*.jsx
  Content-Type: text/javascript; charset=utf-8

/*.js
  Content-Type: text/javascript; charset=utf-8

# Security headers for every HTML response (and all other paths). The MIME
# rules above already set Content-Type for scripts, so adding these headers to
# /* does not disturb script delivery.
#
# CSP notes (browser-only React-over-Babel build):
#   JSX is now PRECOMPILED to .js by build-jsx.ps1 (esbuild) and React is pinned
#     to production .min.js, so script-src is locked to 'self' + unpkg only: no
#     'unsafe-eval' (no in-browser Babel) and no 'unsafe-inline' (no inline scripts).
#   The CDN host is unpkg.com (React, ReactDOM UMD).
#   style-src keeps 'unsafe-inline' for the inline <style> block and React inline
#     style attributes; font-src allows Google Fonts (IBM Plex Sans, Mono, Serif).
#   connect-src allows the production Worker origin (RSS proxy fetch) and the
#     local dev proxy at localhost:3001 / 127.0.0.1:3001.
#   frame-src allows the YouTube live embed. img-src allows YouTube thumbnail + data URIs.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https://i.ytimg.com https://*.ytimg.com; connect-src 'self' https://aph-proxy.jvega019.workers.dev http://localhost:3001 http://127.0.0.1:3001; frame-src https://www.youtube.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'self'
